<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on SCOR.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on SCOR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on shares of Scor SA, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    230 FFR		   ISSUE PRICE  21 FFR</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   28.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	19.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
